    "explanation": "Overview\nâ€¢ Suggested level: 22\nâ€¢ Difficulty: Hard\nâ€¢ Length: Medium\nâ€¢ Estimated time: 1m 30s\n\nRoute\nâ€¢ The cave is a simple circular boss arena. Several melee Dark Cultists (Lv. 20) can be found around the entrance to the cave. The Sacrificial Altar miniboss is in the center of the arena, and three ranged Dark Cultists (Lv. 21) appear around it.\nâ€¢ Miniboss: The Sacrificial Altar fires ranged attacks and is immune to knockback, blindness, and slowness. Additionally, the Altar can use the Push spell to push the player away from it. Defeating the Altar will unleash the second phase of the fight, the Spirit of Vexation.\n\nLoot Chests\nâ€¢ 1x Tier 3 [âœ«âœ«âœ«âœ«]\n\nEnemies\nâ€¢ Dark Cultists (Lv. 20)\nâ€¢ Dark Cultists (Lv. 21)\nâ€¢ Sacrificial Altar (Lv. 25)\n\nFirst-Time Clear Rewards\nâ€¢ +500 XP",
